    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>S. Petersen's Field Guide to Lovecraftian Horrors</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Sandy Petersen Lynn Willis Mike Mason Loïc Muzy Mariusz Gandzel Claire Delépée United States English Genre(s) Bestiary Chaosium Release Date December 2015 130 S. Petersen’s Field Guide to Lovecraftian Horrors is an illustrated bestiary published in 2015 by Chaosium . The book is a revamp of the previous illustrated reference books S. Petersen's Field Guide to Cthulhu Monsters and S. Petersen's Field Guide to Creatures of the Dreamlands . Content The Monsters of the Mythos Azathoth Byakhee Chthonian Dark Young Deep One Dhole Dimensional Shambler Elder Thing Flying Polyp Formless Spawn Fungi from Yuggoth Ghast Ghoul Great Race of Yith Hound of Tindalos Hunting Horror Ithaqua Nyarlathotep Serpent People Servitor of the Outer Gods Shantak Shoggoth Shub-Niggurath Star Spawn of Cthulhu Star Vampire Tsathoggua Yog-Sothoth Creatures of the Dreamlands Abhoth Atlach-Nacha Basilisk Being of Ib Bokrug Buopoth Butterfly-Dragon Cat from Saturn Cloudbeast Fire Worm of Parg Gnor Great One Gug Haemophore Lamp-Eft Larva of the Outer Gods Leng Spider Magah Bird Man of Leng Minion of Karakal Moon-beast Night-gaunt Voonith Wamp Zoog</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Lynn_Willis"/>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Mike_Mason"/>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Sandy_Petersen"/>
