    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#GamingSupplements"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>World War Cthulhu: Europe Ablaze</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various English Call of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Cubicle 7 Entertainment Release Date 2014 144 is a scenario supplement containing six scenarios for Chaosium 's Call of Cthulhu roleplaying game, all of which take place in their World War II setting. Written by an ensemble team of games designers and running to 144 , it was published by Cubicle 7 Entertainment in 2014; both paperback and digital editions were released. Overview External Links at RPG.net review at DriveThruRPG Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Roleplaying game</ex:hasGenreW>
