    <rdfs:label>Secrets of Kenya</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The Mythos Roams Wild David Conyers David Lee Ingersoll David Conyers Paul Carrick Cover Artist David Lee Ingersoll United States English Call of Cthulhu Chaosium Release Date May 2008 248 : The Mythos Roams Wild is a background and scenario recourcebook for the Call of Cthulhu horror roleplaying game. Written by David Conyers , it runs to a total of 248 and was published by Chaosium in May 2008. Artwork was provided by Conyers, David Lee Ingersoll , and Paul Carrick . Originally released in paperback, as of October 2023 it is only available as a PDF download. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#David_Conyers"/>
