    <rdfs:label>Fall of Cthulhu Volume 2: The Gathering</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Fall of cthulhu volume 3: the gray man is a comic book omnibus collecting issues 5 - 10 of michael alan nelson's fall of cthulhu series . The overarching plot involves mr. arkham gathering the beings known as the horsemen of nyarlathotep to his service .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Michael_Alan_Nelson"/>
