    <rdfs:label>The Studies of Dr. Reid</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Peter rawlik's "pickman's model" is a short story by american author . It was published in the thematic anthology pickman's gallery by ulthar press in 2018 . In the story, dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr. dr</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Peter_Rawlik"/>
