    <rdfs:label>Death</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>H. P. Lovecraft United States English Arkham House Something About Cats and Other Pieces Date of writing November 1918 date 1949 " " is a poem by the late American Howard Phillips Lovecraft . Although it was written in November 1918, it did not see until its inclusion in the Arkham House collection Something About Cats and Other Pieces in 1949 , twelve years after Lovecraft’s passing. History Something About Cats and Other Pieces (1949) Collected Poems (1963) The World of H. P. Lovecraft (1971) Fungi from Yuggoth and Other Poems (1971) The Californian: 1934-1938 (1977) References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
