    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Little Glass Bottle</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>"the mystery of the grave-yard" is a short story by the late american h.p. Lovecraft . Written when he was only seven years old, it forms part of his juvenilia body of work . Written in 1897,did not see print until years after lovecraft's death, when it was included in the anthology the shuttered room and other pieces in 1959 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
