    <ex:hasAnnotation>George T. Wetzel United States English Genre(s) Non-fiction SSR Publications Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies date 1955 " " is a short non-fiction piece by American and Howard Phillips Lovecraft scholar George T. Wetzel . History Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies (1955) Commentaries (1955) HPL (1972) H. P. Lovecraft: Four Decades of Criticism (1980, 1981)</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#George_T._Wetzel"/>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
