    <ex:hasAnnotation>Also known as The Subconscious Mind of Cthulhu Cthulhu Cthulhu First appearance The Shore Created by Ares Dragonis is the manifestation of Cthulhu's mind, created by Ares Dragonis for the video game, The Shore .</ex:hasAnnotation>
