    <rdfs:label>Gerald Canevin</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Created by whitehead is a fictional character created by whitehead for a series of supernatural stories . Most of the stories were published in fantasy themed magazines such as weird tales and strange tales . The last one, " scar-tissue", was published in the science fiction themed amazing stories .</ex:hasAnnotation>
