    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Rainy Day Fun Activity Book</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Michael Zug English Genre(s) Puzzle book Jolly Roger Games Release Date 2002 64 The is an activity puzzle book targeted to appeal to a wide range of reader ages. Written by Michael Zug, it was published in a paperback format by Jolly Roger Games in 2002. Since its release, the book has received highly favourable reviews . Overview References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Michael Zug</ex:hasAuthorW>
