    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Ancient Track: The Complete Poetical Works of H. P. Lovecraft</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>H. P. Lovecraft United States English Night Shade Books Hippocampus Press (second revised edition) Release Date July 2001 August 2013 (second revised edition) is, as it’s name might give away, a comprehensive collection of the poetry of late American H. P. Lovecraft . Overview was first published by Night Shade Books in July 2001. A second revised edition was issued by Hippocampus Press in August 2013. Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
