    <rdfs:label>Arkham Unveiled</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Call of cthulhu supplement includes 4 scenarios for keepers . Most information was drawn from materials written by lovecraft . Original materials are also included to "fill in the blanks"</ex:hasAnnotation>
