    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Viking's Stone</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>"the caller of the blackthe mirror of nitocris "is a cthulhu mythos story by brian lumley . It first appeared in the horror at oakdeene and others (arkham house, 1977) it tells the story of occult investigator titus crow .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Brian_Lumley"/>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Cthulhu Mythos</ex:hasGenreW>
