    <rdfs:label>The Grand Grimoire of Cthulhu Mythos Magic</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Mike Mason Matthew Sanderson English Chaosium Release Date 2017 200 is a supplement book by Chaosium for their Call of Cthulhu RPG . It contains 550+ Call of Cthulhu spells from across thirty years' worth of supplements, scenarios, and campaigns, all revised for the system's 7th edition. Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
