    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Blasphemy In The Canopic Jar</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Horror horrors &amp; abominations: 24 tales of the cthulhu mythos date december 2018is a short story by authors mark mclaughlin and michael sheehan, jr. it functions as a follow-up to " the colossus in the catacombs " the evil cultist mupp uses his magic to merge himself with a hunter of antiquities, transforming</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Mark_McLaughlin"/>
