    <rdfs:label>Blasphemous Tomes: A Guide to Lovecraftiana in the Small Press</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Leigh Blackmore Chris A. Masters Bryce Stevens English Genre(s) Non-fiction Shoggoth Issue 2 date June 1992 " " is a short non-fiction piece by authors Leigh Blackmore , Chris A. Masters , and Bryce Stevens . It was included in the first issue of the Shoggoth fanzine in June 1992 . References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Bryce_Stevens"/>
