    <rdfs:label>Lovecraftiana Vol 3, Issue 1</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Dominique Signoret Jens Heimdahl László Báti Віщун draldede Cover Artist Vile Assinen English Rogue Planet Press Release Date April 2018 78  is an issue of the periodical Lovecraftiana , edited by Gavin Chappell and published by Rogue Planet Press in April 2018. Contents "Walpurgas Night" by John Michael Greer "Arcanum Miskatonica" by Mike Adamson "Cosmic Aggressions" by Chad Eagleton "Cathy Hulu" by James Harper "Muhld'enda of the Deep" by Tom Bont "The Book" by JC Weir "The Cthulhu Files" by Mathias Jansson "The Dream-Verse of Robt. Olmstead of Oberlin, Ohio" by Patrick J.K. Gray "A Dormant Sense of Strangeness" by Vincent H. O'Neil "What Time We Have" by Jacob Jones-Goldstein</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
