    <rdfs:label>Marvel Zombies vs. Army of Darkness</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>John Layman Fabiano Neves, Sean Phillips, Fernando Blanco English Marvel Comics Release Date May 2007 - Sept 2007 Media Type Comic book Marvel Zombies Vs Army of Darkness is a 5-part mini-series written by John Layman as part of the Army of Darkness series. Synopsis Ash Williams finds himself in the Zombiverse, an Earth overrun by superhuman zombies .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>John Layman</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>May 2007 - Sept 2007</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
