    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Green Meadow</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Polaris beyond the wall of sleepis a short story by h. p. lovecraft and winifred v. jackson written in 1918/19 . Lovecraft wrote the entire text but jackson is credited, since it was based on a dream she had experienced . Lovecraft wrote the entire text but jackson is credited, since it was based on a dream she had experienced .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Howard Phillips Lovecraft as Lewis Theobald</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Jun.</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Winifred V. Jackson as Elizabeth Neville Berkeley</ex:hasAuthorW>
