    <ex:hasAnnotation>The children of y'golonac are a fictional race created by chaosium in 1995 for the call of cthulhu roleplaying game . They are based on ramsey campbell 's creation y'golonac, their palms have biting fanged</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:wasCreatedByC rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Chaosium"/>
