    <rdfs:label>In the Shadows</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>62 is a scenario sourcebook for horror roleplaying game call of cthulhu . Contains three stand-alone adventures plus all of the necessary handouts and maps . Written by gary sumpter, with cover art supplied by eric vogt .</ex:hasAnnotation>
