    <rdfs:label>The Order of the Stone</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Jared Twing Lynne Hardy Paul Fricker Various Cover Artist Nicola Silvani English Call of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Chaosium Release Date September 2024 154 is a campaign supplement for the Call of Cthulhu horror roleplaying game. Written by Jared Twing, Lynne Hardy , and Paul Fricker , it was published by Chaosium in September 2024 ; both hardcover and digital editions were released. Overview Design Team Written by: Paul Fricker , Lynne Hardy , and Jared Twing Artwork by: Bloom Báirseach, Hannah Elizabeth Baker, John Barry Ballaran, János Brumár, Massimiliano Bruni, Gabriel Campagnolo, Andrew Clark, Andrew J. Clark, Erik Davis-Heim, Gabriel Fecury, Susanah Grace, Heikki Korhonen, Nikoloz Baloo Kuparadze, Herman Lau, Pat Loboyko, Raphael Lucchini, Stjepan Lukac, Luke Marcatili, João Mileski, Kelsey Phillips, Nathaniel Pilgrim, Matt Ryan (IV), Nicola Silvani, Riku Simila, John Sumrow, and Kathryne Emily Erlano Wilson Production staff: Paul Fricker, Lynne Hardy, Meredith Katz, Chandler Kennedy, Mike Mason , Susan O'Brien, and Lucia Versprille Trivia One of the characters who features in this campaign, Abram Bethnell, was created by the late American games designer Keith "Doc" Herber for the 1990 supplement Arkham Unveiled . He was included in with a profile generated by Lynne Hardy . Gallery References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Lynne_Hardy"/>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Paul_Fricker"/>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Jared Twing</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Roleplaying game</ex:hasGenreW>
