    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Call of Poohthulhu</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Carmen Cerra Cover Artist Carmen Cerra English April Moon Books Release Date May 2022 227  is an anthology of stories which blend Lovecraftian horror with British A. A. Milne's beloved children's character Winnie the Pooh. Edited by Neil Baker , it was issued through his own publishing house, April Moon Books , in May 2022. Overview Contents Introduction by Neil Baker " The Celery at the Threshold " by John Linwood Grant " The Very Black Goat " by Christine Morgan " Back to the Black Bog " by Lee Clark Zumpe " Where Howls the Edgog " by Pete Rawlik " Head Like a Jar " by Edward M. Erdelac " In Which We Discover the 101st Acre " by Robert P. Ottone " Eeyore Makes a Friend " by Jackson Parker " When She Was Very Tired " by Lisa Cunningham " The Statement of Eeyore Carter " by Kevin Wetmore " Acrewood " by Jude Reid Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>227</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>May 2022</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
