    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Courting Madness</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>48 is an anthology collection of material for chaosium's call of cthulhu horror roleplaying game . Compiled by pagan publishing for gencon 1992 - from which it was ultimately banned as a result of the suggestive nature of blair reynolds' cover art . Contained resources collected from issues 1 - 3 of gaming magazine the unspeakable oath . Released in extremely limited run of 200 copies .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Roleplaying game</ex:hasGenreW>
