    <rdfs:label>The Rise of Yig</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Alastor Guzman Kurt Komoda Cover Artist Kurt Komoda English Fate of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Evil Hat Productions Release Date 2021 29 is a timeline supplement for the Fate of Cthulhu horror roleplaying game. Written by Alastor Guzman and featuring artwork by Kurt Komoda, it was published digitally by Evil Hat Productions in 2021 . Overview References</ex:hasAnnotation>
