    <ex:hasAnnotation>102 is a children's book, written and illustrated by r. j. ivankovic . Both versions are faithful adaptations of h. p. lovecraft 's " the call of cthulhu ", done in the style of a dr seuss book .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
