    <rdfs:label>Fungi from Yuggoth (Pickman's Press)</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Fungi from Yuggoth H. P. Lovecraft United States English Pickman's Press Release Date December 2021 Fungi from Yuggoth is a chapbook edition of H. P. Lovecraft 's 1929 sonnet cycle . It was released digitally and in paperback by independent Pickman's Press in December 2021. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
