    <ex:hasAnnotation>Psychopompos H. P. Lovecraft United States English Pickman's Press Release Date December 2020 Psychopompos is a chapbook edition of H. P. Lovecraft 's 1919 narrative poem . It was released digitally by independent Pickman's Press in December 2020. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
