  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#Royceton_University">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Location"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Structures"/>
    <rdfs:label>Royceton University</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>General Information Educational Institute Real World Information Created by James Ambuehl is an educational facility created by James Ambuehl for inclusion in his entries to the Cthulhu Mythos inspired by the works of H. P. Lovecraft . Overview is located in the American town of Braving, Minnesota . Much like Miskatonic University (from which it clearly takes its inspiration) Royceton boasts an impressive library of occult grimoires. Library The Elder Oracles , by Reverend Thomas Skyler ( EXP : " The Terror of Toad Lake ") Litaniae ad Deum Fraceum , author unknown ( EXP : "The Terror of Toad Lake") Papyrus of Khamon-Ra , ( EXP : "The Terror of Toad Lake") The Sky-Fathers , by unknown Kaygeema Indian. ( EXP : "The Terror of Toad Lake") Faculty Other Employees Student Body and Alumni</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasPurposeL>Educational Institute</ex:hasPurposeL>
  </rdf:Description>
