    <rdfs:label>Lurkers</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The in the abyss and other tales of terror was first published in 2013 . It also appeared in the zine lovecraftiana vol 5, issue 1 in 2020 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#David_A._Riley"/>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Weird fiction</ex:hasGenreW>
