    <rdfs:label>Bayt al Azif, Issue 3, November 2020</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Bayt al Azif Various Various English Bayt al Azif Genre(s) Roleplaying game 120 Preceded by Issue 2 Followed by Issue 4 Bayt al Azif Issue 3 is the third issue of sporadic Cthulhu Mythos roleplaying magazine Bayt al Azif . Running to a total of 120 , it was published in November 2020; paperback, hardcover, and digital formats were all released. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
