    <ex:hasAccessibilityL>Sea</ex:hasAccessibilityL>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>A fictional town in the marvel universe which first appeared in 1972 in issue #4 of the 1st volume of the marvel premiere comic series . It's a pastiche of the innsmouth of canon . A serpent-twined inverted cross was brought into town, which resulted in sligguth's power infiltrating the population .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasNotableFeatureL>Buildings</ex:hasNotableFeatureL>
