    <ex:hasAnnotation>Robert E. Briney United States English Genre(s) Non-fiction SSR Publications Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies date 1955 " " is a short bibliographical piece by the late American and artist Robert E. Briney. It is a companion piece to George T. Wetzel 's " Amateur Press Works ", listing those works of H. P. Lovecraft 's which were published through professional outlets, along with other pieces not covered in it’s partner compilation. History Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies (1955) Bibliographies (1955)</ex:hasAnnotation>
