    <ex:ceasedOnC>1916</ex:ceasedOnC>
    <ex:hasAffiliationC>Canadian Armed Forces</ex:hasAffiliationC>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Sir is a character created by h.p. Lovecraft in his episodic story " herbert west--reanimator " a military surgeon on the western front during the great war . He is first a supporter of west in his reanimation experiments, and then becomes west's nemesis .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:madeFirstAppearanceOnC rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Herbert_West--Reanimator"/>
