    <rdfs:label>Miskatonic Missives, Vol. I No. 1</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Cover Artist Justin Baird English Miskatonic Missives Helios House Press Release Date 2022 108 is a collectors edition book dedicated to the works of H. P. Lovecraft . Running to a total of 108 , it was published in a hardcover format by Helios House Press in 2022. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
