    <rdfs:label>King of Chicago</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>64 &amp; the secrets of marseilles is a scenario supplement book for the call of cthulhu roleplaying game . It boasts the tagline " prohibition, a gangland murder, the casbah of marseilles, black market weapons" the bulk of the content is taken up by two stand-alone scenarios thematically linked through interaction with a criminal element .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Earl_Geier"/>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Gary_Sumpter"/>
