    <rdfs:label>Crypt of Cthulhu Candlemas 1988</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Edited by price and featuring cover art by robert h. knox, it ran to a total of 48 in an a5 format . The issue was a special "lovecraft's fragments" edition . It was published by cryptic publications in february 1988 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
