    <ex:hasAnnotation>Horror short story by american writer robert bloch first published in 1935 issue of weird tales . It is the first story of the robert blake cycle . The story focuses on a college student who hopes to become a writer of weird fiction pulp .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Robert_Bloch"/>
