    <rdfs:label>Terrors From Beyond</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>First released is 2009, it is currently only available as a digital download . " Ghost light ": the players investigate the disappearance of scottish lighthouse keepers . " Grave secrets ": the traditionalist townsfolk of stafford, rhode island are threatened by a supernatural menace which seeks to harvest their children.</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Brian_Courtemanche"/>
