    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Lowndes, Lovecraft and the Health Knowledge Years</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Mike Ashley English Cryptic Publications Crypt of Cthulhu Candlemas 1989 date February 1989 " " is a short non-fiction work by prolific English , editor and critic Mike Ashley. It was published in the Candlemas 1989 edition of Robert M. Price 's long-running fanzine Crypt of Cthulhu in February of that year.</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Mike Ashley</ex:hasAuthorW>
