    <rdfs:label>Call of Cthulhu (Role-Playing Game)</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Call of cthulhu is a horror fiction role-playing game based on h.p. Lovecraft's story of the same name and the associated cthulhu mythos . The game was first released in 1981, and eighteen editions (mostly fairly minor revisions) have been published to date .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Paul_Fricker"/>
