    <rdfs:label>Bumps in the Night</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>120 is a scenario supplement for chaosium 's call of cthulhu horror roleplaying game . Written by john h. crowe iii , it featured artwork by samuel araya, heather hudson, rhonda libbey, and rick sardhina . Originally intended to contain three adventures, but ended up including five .</ex:hasAnnotation>
