    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu 4 Kids: Old Ones at the Beach: Volume 1</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Luke J. Morris Mo Simpson English Genre(s) Children’s Release Date January 2014 46 Followed by Cthulhu 4 Kids: Raising R'lyeh: Volume 2 is a children’s book written by Luke J. Morris and illustrated by Mo Simpson. It was self-published through the CreateSpace platform in January 2014; both paperback and digital editions were released. Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Luke J. Morris</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Children’s</ex:hasGenreW>
