  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#Eldritch_Chrome">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Chaosium"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Ebooks"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#OtherAuthors"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Eldritch Chrome</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Unquiet Tales of a Mythos-Haunted Future Various Cover Artist Daniele Serra United States English Call of Cthulhu Fiction Chaosium Release Date October 2013 267 : Unquiet Tales of a Mythos-Haunted Future is a thematic anthology of Cthulhu Mythos /science fiction stories. Edited by long-time collaborators Brian M. Sammons and Glynn Owen Barrass , it was published by Chaosium in October 2013 as part of their Call of Cthulhu Fiction line. Both paperback and digital editions were released. Contents Introduction by Brian M. Sammons &amp; Glynn Owen Barrass "Obsolete, Absolute" by Robert M. Price "The Place that Cannot Be" by D. L. Snell "The Battle of Arkham" by Peter Rawlik "The Wurms In the Grid" by Nickolas Cook " SymbiOS " by William Meikle "Playgrounds of Angolaland" by David Conyers "Sonar City" by Sam Stone "The Blowfly Manifesto" by Tim Curran "Flesh &amp; Scales" by Ran Cartwright "Inlibration" by Michael Tice "Hope Abandoned" by Tom Lynch "Immune" by Terrie Leigh Relf "Real Gone" by David Dunwoody "CL3ANS3" by Carrie Cuinn "Dreams of Death" by Lois Gresh "The Gauntlet" by Glynn Owen Barrass and Brian M. Sammons "Indifference" by C. J. Henderson " Open Minded " by Jeffrey Thomas</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>267</ex:hasPageCountW>
