    <ex:hasAnnotation>Artifacts from the world's scariest university is a gaming aid for the call of cthulhu horror roleplaying game . Featuring artwork by gahan wilson, carolyn schultz, ron leming, yurek chodak, and lisa</ex:hasAnnotation>
