    <rdfs:label>Cold Harvest</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>: roleplaying during the great purges is a supplement book for mythos roleplaying game call of cthulhu . It contains player handouts, a set of pre-generated investigators and guidelines on how to play games of call of cthulhu in soviet-era russia .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Chad J. Bowser</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>64</ex:hasPageCountW>
