    <rdfs:label>Lovecraftiana Vol 2, Issue 4</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Angela Sprecher Jen Heimdahl Sofyan Syarief Cover Artist Julien Noirel English Rogue Planet Press Release Date January 2018 68  is an issue of the periodical Lovecraftiana , edited by Gavin Chappell and published by Rogue Planet Press in January 2018. Contents "Father of Serpents" by Charlie Walls "Wally's World" by Michael Lausier "Monarch of the Shadows" by Mike Adamson "It Happened Out Woop Woop" by MT Frederick "Leviathan" by Jeffery Chen "Spells of Dead Witches" by Matthew Wilson</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>68</ex:hasPageCountW>
