    <ex:hasAffiliationC>Elder Gods</ex:hasAffiliationC>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Elder Gods First appearance " Nightmare's Disciple " Created by Joseph S. Pulver, Sr. is an Elder God . Little is known about this entity.</ex:hasAnnotation>
