    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#GreatOldOnes"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosCharacters"/>
    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAffiliationC>Great Old Ones Cthulhu Cult Deep Ones</ex:hasAffiliationC>
    <ex:hasAlternativeNamesC>See here</ex:hasAlternativeNamesC>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Also known as see here exp : vhoorl , 23rd nebula outer space current location r'lyeh powers and abilities oneiropathy regeneration shapeshifting immortality relatives hpl : azathoth (great-great-grandfather) the nameless mist (great-grandparent) yog-sothoth (grandfather) shub-niggurath (grandmother) nug (parent</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAppearanceC>000 Years Under the Sea The Hidden Cthulhu Saves Christmas The Three Stooges vs. Cthulhu Godzilla vs. Cthulhu: A Death May Die Story</ex:hasAppearanceC>
    <ex:hasAppearanceC>Cthulhu The Collect Call of Cathulhu White Darkness The Strange Doom of Enos Harker Hear the Squidman Speak Prank Call of Cthulu And Another Thing... Cthulhu Saves the World 20</ex:hasAppearanceC>
    <ex:hasAppearanceC>History of the Necronomicon The Dunwich Horror The Electric Executioner The Mound Medusa's Coil The Whisperer in Darkness At the Mountains of Madness The Shadow Over Innsmouth The Horror in the Museum Through the Gates of the Silver Key Winged Death The Secret of Kralitz The Invaders The Terror from the Depths Strange Eons The Return of Hastur The House on Curwen Street Something in Wood The Black Island The House in the Valley The Seal of R'lyeh The Final War The House of Cthulhu The Transition of Titus Crow Mylakhrion the Immortal The Horror on the Beach I</ex:hasAppearanceC>
    <ex:hasCharacterMateC>Kay Keith Idh-yaa Kassogtha Sk'tai</ex:hasCharacterMateC>
