    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Shadow Over Washington</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Chris Spivey English Cthulhu Confidential Genre(s) Roleplaying game Pelgrane Press 40 is a scenario supplement for Pelgrane Press 's Cthulhu Mythos roleplaying game Cthulhu Confidential , written by Chris Spivey , one of the creators of the core game. Initially only published as a digital download, it was later included in the omnibus collection Even Death Can Die . Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
