    <rdfs:label>The Other: Encounters with the Cthulhu Mythos Book 1</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The nyarlathotep cycle is a series of short stories by troy young . The stories are in essence chapters in a novel . In 2023, the stories contained in book 1 were included in the paperback compendium the nyarlathotep cycle: the other omnibus .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Troy_Young"/>
