    <rdfs:label>Goodnight Azathoth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>H. P. Lovecraft (original stories) Kenneth Hite (adaptation) Christina Rodriguez English Genre(s) Children's Atlas Games Release Date October 2015 32 is a children's book, published by Atlas Games in 2015. It was written by Kenneth Hite and features illustrations by Christina Rodriguez. Part of the Mini Mythos series, it is a Lovecraftian parody of Margaret Wise Brown's Goodnight Moon . Overview</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
