    <rdfs:label>Dagon May-June 1985</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various United Kingdom English Release Date May 1985 is the seventh issue of the Lovecraftian fanzine Dagon . It was edited by the late British published and occasional Carl T. Ford . Contents (incomplete) "Lovecraft as a Literary Anomaly" by Peter F. Jeffery "De Vermis Mysteriis" by Andy Bennison "The Nameless Offspring" comic strip by N. Basi and C. Ford "Jinx" by Simon Nicholson</ex:hasAnnotation>
