    <rdfs:label>Demiurge</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The story was published in the collection : the complete cthulhu mythos tales of michael shea in december 2017 . It was written by the late american author michael shea . He died three years before the story was published .</ex:hasAnnotation>
