    <rdfs:label>Faster, Vampussy ... Kill, Kill!</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>" faster, vampussy ... kill, kill! " Is a short story by alex s. johnson . It was published in the james ward kirk thematic anthology lovecraft after dark in november 2015 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
