    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Codex Eastertide 1997</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Cover Artist Richard Corben English Necronomicon Press Release Date April 1997 40 Preceded by November 1996 Followed by Lammas 1997 is the tenth issue of the Necronomicon Press fanzine Cthulhu Codex . Running to a total of 40 , it was edited by Robert M. Price , featured cover art by Richard Corben, and was published in April 1997. Contents Editorial: From the Scriptorium by Robert M. Price " Pazuzu's Children " by Jeffrey Thomas "The Alternate Manuscript" by John Shire " The Stalker in the Snows " by James Ambuehl " The Black Brat of Dunwich " by Stanley C. Sargent "The Dervishes" by Frederick Stansfield "Fear-Stars" by Ann K. Schwader</ex:hasAnnotation>
