    <rdfs:label>A Look at Lovecraft's Letters</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>S. T. Joshi United States English Genre(s) Non-fiction Crypt of Cthulhu #46 date April 1987 " " is a short non-fiction piece by prominent H. P. Lovecraft scholar S. T. Joshi . It was first published in issue #46 of fanzine Crypt of Cthulhu in April 1987, and has also been included in the collections of Joshi's works Selected Papers on Lovecraft (June 1989, Necronomicon Press ) and Primal Sources: Essays on H. P. Lovecraft (2003, Hippocampus Press ).</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#S._T._Joshi"/>
