    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Spawn of Azathoth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Herald of the end of time is a campaign supplement for the roleplaying game call of cthulhu . First edition was written by keith herber and released in 1986 as a boxed set containing three booklets . Second edition was released in 2005 as a 200-page softcover book with new artwork and a cover provided by tom sullivan .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Keith Herber et al.</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
