    <rdfs:label>Shadows of Yog-Sothoth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>First scenario supplement for call of cthulhu roleplaying game . Contains a seven-part campaign and two stand-alone adventures . Takes the players across the globe in pursuit of the cult of the hermetic order of the silver twilight .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
