    <rdfs:label>Shoggoth (fanzine)</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Shoggoth was a short lived lovecraftian fanzine edited and self-published by australian author chris a. Masters . The zine ran for only two issues between</ex:hasAnnotation>
