    <rdfs:label>The Grey Rite of Azathoth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The dark rites of cthulhu was published in the anthology the dark rites of cthulhu in march 2014 . It was written by american and editor robert m. price .</ex:hasAnnotation>
