    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Were-Snake</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Wtis a horror short story by frank belknap long, published in the september 1925 issue of weird tales . It briefly mentions "the mad arab alhazred ", a character created by long's friend h. p. lovecraft in " the nameless city "</ex:hasAnnotation>
  </rdf:Description>
