    <rdfs:label>Zealia Bishop</rdfs:label>
    <ex:diedOnR>1968</ex:diedOnR>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Zealia brown-reed bishop was an american writer of short stories . Her stories appeared in the magazine weird tales . They were extensively revised by h.p. Lovecraft to the point of being ghostwritten .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasFullNameR>Zealia Brown-Reed Bishop</ex:hasFullNameR>
    <ex:hasNationalityR>United States</ex:hasNationalityR>
