    <rdfs:label>The Book of Chaos, Vol. 2: Infernum in Terra</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The book of chaos is a short graphic novel written by mathieu lauffray and xavier dorison, with lauffray also suppling the artwork . It was released digitally in may 2017 by humanoids in partnership with comixology .</ex:hasAnnotation>
