    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Book of Chaos, Vol. 3: Pater Tenebrarum</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The book of chaos is a short graphic novel written by mathieu lauffray and xavier dorison . It was first published in french as prophet 03: pater tenebrarum in 2005; an english translation has since been published . A group of survivors attempt to reach the stele which they believe might hold a chance for redemption .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Mathieu Lauffray</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Xavier Dorison</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
