    <rdfs:label>Achtung! Cthulhu: Investigator's Guide to the Secret War</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The investigator's guide to the secret war is a background supplement for achtung! Cthulhu world war ii horror roleplaying game . It was written by dave blewer, alex bund, adam crossingham, sarah newton, and mathew pook .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
