    <rdfs:label>Nietzscheism and Realism</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>H. P. Lovecraft United States English (original) French Genre(s) Non-fiction SSR Publications Selected Essays Volume I Date of writing October 1921 date December 1952 " " is a short non-fiction piece by the late American Howard Phillips Lovecraft . Although it was written in October 1921, it did not see print until its inclusion in the George T. Wetzel -edited collection Selected Essays Volume I in December 1952 . History Selected Essays Volume I (1952) To Quebec and the Stars (1976) Howard Phillips Lovecraft 3 (1992, 2016) Miscellaneous Writings (1995) References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Non-fiction</ex:hasGenreW>
