    <ex:hasAnnotation>Fritz Leiber United States English Genre(s) Non-fiction Arkham House The Dark Brotherhood and Other Pieces date 1966 " " is a short non-fiction piece by Howard Phillips Lovecraft 's correspondent and contemporary Fritz Leiber . History The Dark Brotherhood and Other Pieces (1966) H. P. Lovecraft: Four Decades of Criticism (1980, 1981) Lovecraft Remembered (1998)</ex:hasAnnotation>
