    <rdfs:label>Absinthe in Carcosa</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Robin D. Laws English The Yellow King Genre(s) Roleplaying game Pelgrane Press Release Date 2020 192 is a sourcebook for Pelgrane Press 's Yellow Mythos roleplaying game The Yellow King . Written by the game's creator Robin D. Laws , it was published by Pelgrane in 2020; both print and digital editions were released. Overview The book is written in the form of a scrapbook created by a man whose mind has been shattered by reading the cursed play The King in Yellow . It offers a skewed guide to the city of Paris for use with The Yellow King roleplaying game. Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Robin_D._Laws"/>
