    <ex:hasAnnotation>64 is a sourcebook for chaosium 's historical call of cthulhu offshoot, cthulhu invictus . Contains a trio of scenarios which take investigators to the far reaches of the roman empire .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Chad_Bowser"/>
