    <ex:hasAnnotation>Trail of Cthulhu Kenneth Hite Robin D. Laws Simon Rogers Jérôme Huguenin Cover Artist Jérôme Huguenin English Trail of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Pelgrane Press Release Date 2008 245 The contains everything necessary to get started in Trail of Cthulhu , a rules-light Cthulhu Mythos roleplaying game. Written by Kenneth Hite , Robin D. Laws , and Simon Rogers, and featuring cover art by Jérôme Huguenin, it was published by Pelgrane Press in 2008; both print and digital editions were released . Overview References</ex:hasAnnotation>
