    <rdfs:label>The Death of Vanessa Fell</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The howling terror and other lovecraftian horror stories was published in his collection the howling terror and other lovecraftian horror stories in 2022 . It is a short story about a man named charles who discovers a series of diaries which reveal the fells were cultists in service to many dark gods .</ex:hasAnnotation>
