  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#Inhabitants_of_Innsmouth">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#OtherAuthors"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Inhabitants of Innsmouth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Cover Artist Steve Lines English Rainfall Books Release Date 2006 40 is a chapbook anthology of Lovecraftian fiction. Edited by Steve Lines and John B. Ford , it featured cover art by Lines, ran to a total of 40 in an A5 format, and was published by Rainfall Books in 2006. The cover art, sans text, was later included as a black-and-white plate in the first issue of Ron Shiflet 's short-lived fanzine In Lovecraft's Shadow in March 2007. Contents "Innsmouth Jewelery" by Haydon Atwood Prescott "Memories" by E. P. Berglund "Innsmouth Wood" by Mike Minnis "The Bends" by Peter Worthy "The Call of the Deep" by Phillip A. Ellis "Song of the Deep One" by Lucy Francis</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>40</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>2006</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#Mnggal-Mnggal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Character"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#ExtraterrestrialCharacters"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosCharacters"/>
    <rdfs:label>Mnggal-Mnggal</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The is a terrifying and mysterious entity known throughout the unknown regions . It was a sentient, shape-shifting organism that was essentially a viral infection, capable of taking over and controlling the bodies of those it infected . Description desired nothing more than control, and subsequently sought to spread its body and influence over as many worlds as possible .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:madeFirstAppearanceOnC>Star Wars: The Unknown Regions</ex:madeFirstAppearanceOnC>
    <ex:wasCreatedByC>Daniel Wallace</ex:wasCreatedByC>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#A._A._Attanasio">
