    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Country Mouse, City Mouse</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>" mouse, city mouse " is a short cthulhu mythos story by american nick mamatas . It was published in the 2017 thematic anthology the children of gla'aki: a tribute to ramsey campbell's great old one . " Mouse, city mouse" is a short story in the 2017 thematic anthology the children of gla'aki .</ex:hasAnnotation>
