    <rdfs:label>The Thing in the Customs House</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The house at the edge of time and space is a short story by canadian author troy young . It was published in the collection the other: encounters with the cthulhu mythos book 2 in 2020 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Troy_Young"/>
