    <rdfs:label>Wunderwaffe</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>" gathering forces " is a short story by american jeffrey thomas . It was first published in the dark regions press anthology world war cthulhu in august 2014 . The story forms the third and final part of a short involving the alien god ugghiutu .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Jeffrey_Thomas"/>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
