    <rdfs:label>William Browning Spencer</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Author of résumé with monsters and maybe i'll call anna . Has written several mythos stories including the novel résumé with monsters which blends soul-destroying horrors with soul-destroying jobs .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasBirthplaceR>United States</ex:hasBirthplaceR>
