    <ex:hasAlternativeNamesC>Ksaksa-Kluth</ex:hasAlternativeNamesC>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Also known as ksaksa-kluth, androgynous offspring of azathoth, illimitable androgynous desire . Is the offspring of azathoth by spontaneous fission . Is the grandparent of tsathoggua .</ex:hasAnnotation>
