    <rdfs:label>The Dunwich Horror and Others</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>H. P. Lovecraft Cover Artist Lee Brown Coye United States English Genre(s) Fantasy Horror Science fiction Arkham House Release Date 1963 431 is a collection of H. P. Lovecraft short stories published by Arkham House in 1963.. Contents Introduction: "H. P. Lovecraft and His Work" by August Derleth HPL : In the Vault HPL : Pickman's Model HPL : The Rats in the Walls HPL : The Outsider HPL : The Colour Out of Space HPL : The Music of Erich Zann HPL : The Haunter of the Dark HPL : The Picture in the House HPL : The Call of Cthulhu HPL : The Dunwich Horror HPL : Cool Air HPL : The Whisperer in Darkness HPL : The Terrible Old Man HPL : The Thing on the Doorstep HPL : The Shadow Over Innsmouth HPL : The Shadow Out of Time</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
