    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu's Polymorphous Perversity</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Kenneth Hite English Genre(s) Non-fiction Dagan Books Cthulhurotica date January 2011 " " is a short non-fiction work by American and games designer Kenneth Hite . It was published in the Carrie Cuinn-edited anthology Cthulhurotica by Dagan Books in January 2011 . References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Kenneth_Hite"/>
