    <rdfs:label>Esther Whipple</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Lovecraft’s maternal great-great-grandmother. Married Asaph Phillips on 16 August 1787. &lt;/li&gt;</ex:hasAnnotation>
