    <rdfs:label>Brad Hollins</rdfs:label>
    <ex:ceasedOnC>1926 Exact date unconfirmed but likely 1925</ex:ceasedOnC>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>"skids" o'toole is a character in the board game of lovecraftian horror . He was created by fantasy flight games as part of the backstory for investigator "skids" o'toole . He first appeared in the flavour text for investigator "skids" in innsmouth horror .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:madeFirstAppearanceOnC>Innsmouth Horror Deluxe Expansion</ex:madeFirstAppearanceOnC>
