    <rdfs:label>George Rogers' Wax Museum</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Created by h.p. Lovecraft is a private collection of waxworks opened in a basement by george rogers . The museum also houses a curtained off alcove displaying an array of pieces too horrifying for the general public .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:isLocatedAtL>London</ex:isLocatedAtL>
