    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Saves the World</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Zeboyd Games Publication Date 2011 Retro RPG is a retro-style RPG video game from indie developer Zeboyd Games , a tongue-in-cheek take on H. P. Lovecraft 's Cthulhu Mythos . It was released in 2011 on Windows XP and Vista. Overview Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:wasPublishedOnW>2011</ex:wasPublishedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
