    <ex:hasAnnotation>Horror horrors &amp; abominations: 24 tales of the cthulhu mythos is a short story by mark mclaughlin and michael sheehan, jr. published in the collection horrors &amp; abominations: 24 tales of the cthulhu mythos .</ex:hasAnnotation>
