    <ex:hasAnnotation>Rita was created by fantasy flight games as part of their arkham horror files line of cthulhu mythos -related content . She first appeared in the expansion dunwich horror . Later appeared in the form of a gaming accessory as part of the arkham horror premium figures line .</ex:hasAnnotation>
