    <rdfs:label>Miskatonic Tales: Journey to Innsmouth</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Chaosium Publication Date 2025 (projected) Board game is an upcoming Cthulhu Mythos board game from tabletop gaming manufacturer Chaosium . Details are scant at the time of writing, but it has been slated for a release sometime in 2025 . Overview References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:wasPublishedOnW>2025</ex:wasPublishedOnW>
