    <ex:hasAnnotation>Mu Hierophant Ythogtha First appearance EXP : " The Thing in the Pit " EXP : " The Dweller in the Tomb " Created by Lin Carter the Hierophant is a character created by Lin Carter , first appearing in his story " The Thing in the Pit . He is portrayed as a Muvian sorcerer and a worshipper of Ythogtha . He is the author of the Tablets , which were later translated by Harold Hadley Copeland .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAppearanceC rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#The_Dweller_in_the_Tomb"/>
