    <ex:hasAnnotation>Kenneth Hite Jérôme Huguenin Cover Artist Jérôme Huguenin English Trail of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Pelgrane Press Release Date 2009 38 is a supplement for the Trail of Cthulhu horror roleplaying game. Written by Kenneth Hite and featuring artwork from Jérôme Huguenin, it was published by Pelgrane Press in 2009 ; both print and digital editions were released. Overview Gallery References</ex:hasAnnotation>
