    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Resurgent</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>David Conyers Cover Artist Tithi Luadthong English Harrison Peel Genre(s) Cthulhu Mythos David Conyers 289 Preceded by Cthulhu Reloaded Followed by Cthulhu Remorseless is a collection of Cthulhu Mythos stories by David Conyers (in two cases with a co-). It is the second book in a collecting the adventures of the recurring character Harrison Peel . It was self-published by Conyers in 2021. Contents "The Spiraling Worm" (2007) (by David Conyers and John Sunseri ) "The Road to Afghanistan" (2013) "The Eye of Infinity" (2014) "The Temporal Deception" (2015) (by David Conyers and C. J. Henderson ) "The Gravity Museum" (2021)</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#David_Conyers"/>
