    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>From the Dark (audio script)</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>From the Dark H. P. Lovecraft (original story) Steven Philip Jones (adaptation) United States English Caliber Comics H. P. Lovecraft's Reanimator Tales date January 2016 " From the Dark " is an audio script written by American and comic book creator Steven Philip Jones , which is based on the first chapter of H. P. Lovecraft 's short story " Herbert West--Reanimator ". It was published by Caliber Comics in the collection H. P. Lovecraft's Reanimator Tales , first released in 2016, subsequently reissued in 2020. Whether the script was ever transferred to an audio medium is unknown.</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#H._P._Lovecraft"/>
