    <rdfs:label>The Seal of R'lyeh</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Original title "The Seal of the Damned" Full story online here August Derleth United States English Fantastic Universe date July 1957 "" is a short Cthulhu Mythos story by August Derleth , first published under the title "The Seal of the Damned" in the July 1957 issue of Fantastic Universe Science Fiction . It is "the last of the pure Derleth Mythos stories published under the sole byline of August Derleth." References</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#August_Derleth"/>
