    <rdfs:label>HPL (1972 collection)</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Hpl is a collection edited by meade and penny frierson . Self-published in a limited run of 1,000 copies in march 1972 . A second run of 500 copies saw release in october of that year .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
