    <ex:hasAlternativeNamesA>Livre d'Eibon</ex:hasAlternativeNamesA>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The also known as liber ivonis livre d'eibon created by eibon place of origin hyperborea used by eibon information and data storage real world information . One of smith's stories, " the coming of the white worm ", is presented as a chapter of the .</ex:hasAnnotation>
