    <ex:diedOnR>29 August 1852</ex:diedOnR>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Daughter of Jeremiah Phillips and Roby Rathbun, she only lived to be 3 years, 7 months, and 22 days old.</ex:hasAnnotation>
