    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Prisoner of Carcosa</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Mark McLaughlin Michael Sheehan, Jr. English Nightmares &amp; Tentacles: 13 Tales Of The Cthulhu Mythos " " is a short story by authors Mark McLaughlin and Michael Sheehan, Jr. Synopsis History "" was published in the collections Nightmares &amp; Tentacles: 13 Tales Of The Cthulhu Mythos and &amp; More Tales Of The Bizarre (2020).</ex:hasAnnotation>
