    <rdfs:label>The Wild Adventures of Cthulhu</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Will Murray Cover Artist Eric Lofgren English Genre(s) Cthulhu Mythos Odyssey Publications Release Date August 25, 2022 240 Followed by : Volume 2 is a collection of Cthulhu Mythos fiction by American Will Murray , published in two volumes in 2022 by Odyssey Publications and featuring cover art by Eric Lofgren. The title is a reference to Murray's collection of Sherlock Holmes stories, The Wild Adventures of Sherlock Holmes (2020). Contents : Volume One "Introduction" (essay) " To Clear the Earth " (1994) " The Eldridge Collection " (2003) "Rude Awakening" (1995) "A Trillion Young" (2017) " Static " (2015) " The Sothis Radiant " (1996) "Dark Redeemer" (2015) "What Brings the Void" (2010) "The Hour of Our Triumph" (2011) "Black Fire" (1995) : Volume Two "Introduction" (essay) "God General Nakji" (2021) "Evacuation Day" (2012) "The Hindmarsh Abomination" (2011) "Moonday" (2022) "In the Lightless Chambers of Hellish N'gah-Kthun" (2022) "The Purple Emperor" (2006) "The Cow-Men of Coburn" (2004) "The Arcade" (2012) "The Wild Ones of Weirport" (2022)</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Will_Murray"/>
    <ex:hasGenreW>Cthulhu Mythos</ex:hasGenreW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>240</ex:hasPageCountW>
