    <ex:hasAnnotation>John H. Crowe III Heather Hudson Cover Artist Dennis Detwiller (front) Heather Hudson (back) English Call of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Pagan Publishing Release Date 1995 is a campaign supplement for Chaosium 's Call of Cthulhu horror roleplaying game. Written by John H. Crowe III and featuring artwork by Heather Hudson and Dennis Detwiller , it was published by third-party content provider Pagan Publishing in 1995 . Overview Contents "Cold Spot" ( set in 1929) "Remains to Be Seen" (set in 1932) "The Whitewood Horror" (set in 1935) "Full Circle" (set in 1939) Design Team Written by: John H. Crowe III Artwork by: Dennis Detwiller , Heather Hudson, Mark Schumann, and John Tynes Production staff: Brian Appleton , Dennis Detwiller, and John Tynes Gallery References</ex:hasAnnotation>
