    <rdfs:label>Fall of Cthulhu</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Followed by hexed is a long-running cthulhu mythos comic book series written by michael alan nelson . The first issue was published by boom! Studios in 2007, with the first story arc running for 15 issues, later collected into three volumes . Since then, three four-issue miniseries have been released ( godwar , 2008; apocalypse , 2009; and . Nemesis ,</ex:hasAnnotation>
