    <rdfs:label>Island of Ignorance: The Third Cthulhu Companion</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>188 is a supplement book for chaosium 's call of cthulhu horror roleplaying game by third-party content provider golden goblin press . Edited by oscar rios and lisa padol, it was published in 2013 . The book contains a selection of articles detailing ways to expand character creation, artefacts, and equipment, as well as five stand-alone scenarios .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
