    <ex:hasAnnotation>Full story online here August Derleth United States English Trail of Cthulhu Weird Tales date January 1952 𝐓 ", Being the Narrative of Horvath Blayne" is a short Cthulhu Mythos story by August Derleth , first published in the January 1952 issue of Weird Tales . It is the fifth and final part of Derleth's Trail of Cthulhu . Like other stories in the , it features Professor Laban Shrewsbury as a major character.</ex:hasAnnotation>
