    <ex:hasAnnotation>The asylum diaries: arkham date may 2019is a short cthulhu mythos story by drew nicks . It was published in the first issue of short-lived horror magazine the asylum diaries by oscillate wildly press in may 2019 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
