    <rdfs:label>Carlyle Expedition</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>General Information Archaeological expedition Research Notable Members Roger Carlyle (leader) Real World Information First appearance EXP : Masks of Nyarlathotep Created by Larry DiTillio Lynn Willis The was a scientific research venture which journeyed to Egypt . It was led by an archaeologist named Roger Carlyle, and it is from him that the group took their name. The expedition eventually went missing ( EXP : Masks of Nyarlathotep ).</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasNotableMemberO>Roger Carlyle</ex:hasNotableMemberO>
    <ex:hasPurposeO>Research</ex:hasPurposeO>
    <ex:hasTypeO>Archaeological expedition</ex:hasTypeO>
