    <ex:hasAnnotation>The real ghostbusters is an episode of the animated supernatural comedy series . It is the third episode to incorporate elements from the cthulhu mythos . It is written by j. michael straczynski and originally aired in 1990 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
