    <rdfs:label>A Lovecraftian Nightmare</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>R. Boerem English Genre(s) Non-fiction Silver Scarab Press Nyctalops #11/12 date April 1976 " " is a short non-fiction piece by writer R. Boerem . History Nyctalops #11/12 (1976) H. P. Lovecraft: Four Decades of Criticism (1980)</ex:hasAnnotation>
