    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#RealWorldPerson"/>
    <rdfs:label>Andrew J. Wilson</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Connection to the Mythos Author Birth Date 1963 Aberdeen, Scotland, UK United Kingdom http://www.andrewjwilsonpublishingservices.co.uk/home is a Scottish author and editor who has written a number of pieces on Lovecraft and his associates and the Cthulhu Mythos . These have been published in anthologies such as the Wildside Press collection Cthulhu: Weirdbook Annual 2 in February 2019. Selected Bibliography Poems " Lovecraftian Limerick " (2019) External Links at the Internet Speculative Fiction Database at Goodreads</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasBirthplaceR>UK Scotland Aberdeen</ex:hasBirthplaceR>
    <ex:hasNationalityR>United Kingdom</ex:hasNationalityR>
