    <rdfs:label>Howard Lovecraft and the Frozen Kingdom</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>96 is a graphic novel published by arcana studio, the first in their howard lovecraft series . Written by bruce brown and featuring artwork by renzo podesta .</ex:hasAnnotation>
