    <rdfs:label>The Lord of R'lyeh</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Matthew H. Onderdonk United States English Genre(s) Non-fiction SSR Publications Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies date 1955 " The Lord of R'yleh ", sometimes published as "", is a short non-fiction work by Matthew H. Onderdonk. History Howard Phillips Lovecraft: Memoirs, Critiques &amp; Bibliographies (1955) Commentaries (1955) Lovecraft Studies #7 (1982) Lovecraft Remembered (1998)</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Matthew H. Onderdonk</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
