    <ex:diedOnR>28 April 1968</ex:diedOnR>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>W. t. scott was an american poet, newspaper editor, broadcaster and occasional critic . He is most notable to this wiki for his early scholarly work on the late howard phillips lovecraft .</ex:hasAnnotation>
