    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Cultus Issue 2</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Cthulhu cultus #3 is an issue of sporadic american fanzine cthulhu cultus . Edited by tani jantsang and published by p. marsh in may 1995 . Features "the call of cthulhu" by tani jantsang and "the dreams of lovecraft &amp; the sun"</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
