  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#The_Shub-Niggurath_Cycle">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Chaosium"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#OtherAuthors"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Shub-Niggurath Cycle</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Dreyfus United States English Chaosium Release Date July 1994 227 : Tales of the Black Goat With a Thousand Young is an anthology of Cthulhu Mythos and Mythos-adjacent stories related in some way to the fictional entity Shub-Niggurath . The collection was edited by Robert M. Price and published by Chaosium in 1994, part of its Cthulhu Cycle series. Contents "Introduction (Shub-Niggurath Cycle)" by Robert M. Price "The Horn of Vapula" by Lewis Spence (1932) "The Demoniac Goat" by M. P. Dare (1947) "The Ghostly Goat of Glaramara" by J. S. Leatherbarrow (1979) " The Moon-Lens " by Ramsey Campbell (1964) "The Ring of the Hyades" by John Glasby "A Thousand Young" by Robert M. Price (1989) " The Seed of the Star-God " by Richard L. Tierney (1984) "Harold's Blues" by Glen Singer (1976) " Dreams in the House of Weir " by Lin Carter (1980) " Visions from Yaddith " (1988) • poem by Lin Carter (1988) "Prey of the Goat" by M. L. Carter "Sabbath of the Black Goat" by Stephen M. Rainey "The Curate of Temphill" by Peter H. Cannon and Robert M. Price (1993) "Grossie" by David Kaufman " To Clear the Earth " by Will Murray</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>227</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>July 1994</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
