    <rdfs:label>Along Came Cthulhu</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Under the moon flub date january 2012is a children’s cthulhu mythos story by american dawna flowers . It was first published in the collection deep in the forest through her independent label under the moon publishing .</ex:hasAnnotation>
