    <ex:hasAnnotation>Sociocultural Characteristics Also known as Hunting-horror Unknown Nyarlathotep Real World Information First appearance HPL : The Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath Created by H. P. Lovecraft The Hunting Horrors are creatures mentioned in Howard Phillips Lovecraft 's The Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath . Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
