  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#The_Round_Tower">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#MythosLiterature"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#OtherAuthors"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Round Tower</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>" (being the narrative of armitage harper) " is a short piece by american robert m. price . It is an alternate ending to august derleth 's the lurker at the threshold , replacing the third and final segment . First appeared in the dunwich cycle: where the old gods wait by chaosium in november 1995 .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Robert_M._Price"/>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
