    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Gav Roachdown Roberto Cantoro BenduKiwi H. P. Lovecraft Cover Artist Gav Roachdown English Rogue Planet Press Release Date April 2016 54  is an issue of the periodical Lovecraftiana , edited by Gavin Chappell and published by Rogue Planet Press in April 2016. Contents "The Terror of the Night" by Joseph Rubas "Recondo" by Seamus Esparza "Riddle of the Stars" by Carl Fox "The Story of Herr Hackenschmidt" by Benjamin Welton "Cosmic Horror from Poe to Lovecraft" by Sandro D. Fossemò "Call of Cthulhu" by Gavin Chappell and Gav Roachdown</ex:hasAnnotation>
