    <rdfs:label>Muriel E. Eddy</rdfs:label>
    <ex:diedOnR>30 January 1978</ex:diedOnR>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Muriel elizabeth (gammons) eddy was a writer born in taunton, massachusetts . She corresponded with lovecraft and was married to collaborator c. m. eddy, jr. she wrote in many genres, including romance, occult, biography and poetry .</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasBirthplaceR>USA http://example.org/lovecraft#Massachusetts Taunton</ex:hasBirthplaceR>
