    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Cultus Issue 18</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Cthulhu Cultus #18 Various Cover Artist Tani Jantsang United States English P. Marsh Release Date March 2001 56 Preceded by Cthulhu Cultus #17 Cthulhu Cultus #18 is the eighteenth and final issue of sporadic American fanzine Cthulhu Cultus , edited by Tani Jantsang and James Ambuehl and published by P. Marsh in March 2001. Contents "Valediction (Part II)" by R. A. Strong "The Snow Thing" by James Ambuehl "Malone" by Duane Pesice "The Manuscript of Professor Loomis" by Jay McIntyre "Chaos Unleashed" by James Ambuehl and Tracy Ambuehl "The Stars Are Not Quite Right" by Philip I. Jones "Black on Black" by Duane Pesice "Cthulhuwocky" by John H. Toon "Necronomicon" by James Ambuehl "The Inheritance" by John Parkinson "Mary" by Chris Lovelace "Howl" by J. W. Kelley</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>United States</ex:hasCountryOfOriginW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>56</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>March 2001</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
