    <rdfs:label>Cthulhu Codex Hallowmas 1998</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Cover Artist Stanley C. Sargent English United States Necronomicon Press Release Date November 2018 44 Preceded by Lammas 1998 Followed by Eastertide 1999 is the fifteenth issue of fanzine Cthulhu Codex , published in November 1998 by Necronomicon Press . Running to a total of 44 , it was edited by Robert M. Price and featured cover art by Stanley C. Sargent . Contents Editorial: From the Scriptorium Cthulhu Codex by Robert M. Price " The Bargain with Yog-Sothoth " by Robert Bee "Inside the Car Wash" by Gregory Luce "After Summer" by John Shire "Third Shift" by Kevin Carson " Corpse Candles " by Jeffrey Thomas "Diary of Andrew Marsh" by C. L. Werner</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>44</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:isPartOfSeriesW>United States</ex:isPartOfSeriesW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>November 2018</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#The_Ancient_Track_October_1998">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Fanzines"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#OtherAuthors"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Work"/>
    <rdfs:label>The Ancient Track October 1998</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>Various Cover Artist Daniel Alan Ross English Release Date October 1998 72 was the first issue of the short-running Lovecraftian fanzine The Ancient Track . Running to a total of 72 , it was edited by Melanie E. Fischer and Todd H. C. Fischer . Featuring cover art by Daniel Alan Ross, it was published independently in October 1998. Contents "The Leatherman" short story by R. A. Strong "Cthulhu War: Genesis" short story by Michael Carter "Sesqua Bud" short story by Chad Hensley " The Slime Girls " short fiction by James Ambuehl " When Old Gods Awaken " (1998) poem by Ron Shiflet "Yule Fest" poem by Alan D. Peschke "The Dreaming of Algernon Early" short story by Todd H. C. Fischer "Thy Cryptic Power" (1987) short story by W. H. Pugmire " Cthulhu's Dark Spawn " (1998) poem by Ron Shiflet " When in Leng... " short story by Ron Shiflet "Black Sun" (1998) short story by G. W. Thomas " The Black Brat of Dunwich " (1997) short story by Stanley C. Sargent "Abyssal Plain" poem by Chad Hensley</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW>Various</ex:hasAuthorW>
    <ex:hasPageCountW>72</ex:hasPageCountW>
    <ex:isInLanguageW>English</ex:isInLanguageW>
    <ex:wasReleasedOnW>October 1998</ex:wasReleasedOnW>
  </rdf:Description>
