    <ex:hasAnnotation>Full story online here Howard Phillips Lovecraft and R. H. Barlow United States English Genre(s) Horror short story Appears in The Hoard of the Wizard-Beast and One Other Necronomicon Press ← Previous Next → " The Hoard of the Wizard-Beast " " The Book "</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Howard_Phillips_Lovecraft"/>
