    <rdfs:label>Secrets of New York</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>William Jones Kathy Ferrell Steven Gilberts Chris Hill Kathy Hill Deborah Jones Bryan Reagan Cover Artist Steven Gilberts United States English Call of Cthulhu Genre(s) Roleplaying game Chaosium Release Date 2005 180 is a sourcebook for Chaosium 's Call of Cthulhu roleplaying game. Written by William Jones , it was first published in a 180-page paperback format in 2005, but is currently only available as a digital download. Overview Gallery</ex:hasAnnotation>
    <ex:hasAuthorW rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#William_Jones"/>
