  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/lovecraft#Daemon_World">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Location"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#LocationsOriginatingFromMythosInspiredWorks"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.org/lovecraft#Planets"/>
    <rdfs:label>Daemon World</rdfs:label>
    <ex:hasAnnotation>The daemon worlds are eldritch planets in the fictional universe of the warhammer 40k tabletop miniature wargame by games workshop . Most of these worlds are ruled by daemon princes, who used the warp's pure psychic mutability to shape the planet's environment . A few daemon worlds exist within realspace, which are under a strict quarantine imposed by the imperial inquisition .</ex:hasAnnotation>
  </rdf:Description>
